[gd_scene format=3]

; Moves one variable: a SkeletonModification2DFABRIK in an enabled stack. No other golden runs a
; FABRIK solve, so none shows a regression in its chain. The three bones, their bar children and
; the strip skinned to them bend until the end of the last bone reaches the red target.

